 * @class .instui-tooltip
 * @summary Visibility styling for the tooltip web component's tip — hidden until the component reveals it.
 * @remarks For a larger, click-triggered anchored surface, see the [popover](/api/css/popover.md) component.
 * @part .tip — The floating tip surface.
 * @cssstate show — The tip is revealed (opaque and visible); without it the tip is hidden.
 * @accessibility The tip is a `role="tooltip"` revealed on both hover and focus, so keyboard users reach it; set its text via the `tip` attribute.
 * @example
 * <instui-tooltip tip="Save your work" placement="bottom">
